>term foldOverTerm = (λorder.λfld.λb0.λ`term`.cases(coders.TraversalOrder){pre=λ`_`.lists.foldl (foldOverTerm order fld) (fld b0 `term`) (subterms `term`), post=λ`_`.fld (lists.foldl (foldOverTerm order fld) b0 (subterms `term`)) `term`} order)@{description="Fold over a term, traversing its subterms in the specified order"}
