>term foldTermWithGraphAndPath = (λf.λcx0.λval0.λterm0.let wrapper := λrecurse.λpath.λcx.λval.λ`term`.let recurseForUser := λvalIn.λsubterm.let r := recurse valIn subterm in pairs.first r in (f recurseForUser path cx val `term`, `term`) in let result := rewriteAndFoldTermWithGraphAndPath wrapper cx0 val0 term0 in pairs.first result)@{description="Fold over a term to produce a value, with both Graph and accessor path tracked. Like rewriteAndFoldTermWithGraphAndPath, but only folds without rewriting. The Graph is automatically updated when descending into lambdas, lets, and type lambdas."}
